#sortorder:2
#showas:铁獾
This is intended for a very different experience than most campaigns.

There are 2 AIs on the Cubular map.

There are a bunch of random factions on the map. You will not know what these factions are until you find them, so quick exploration is key to not getting blindsided. These factions are randomly selected each time you start the scenario.

Finally, the game is in Ironman mode, so you must be on your toes.

The goal of this is to challenge a player's ability to react to unknown threats. Perfect play is impossible; Survival is imperative.